{"id":"6d3740a124021b84","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Power Set Closed Hull","display":"df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull — ZFC Set10 Power Set Closed Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull — ZFC Set10 Power Set Closed Hull","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-power-set-closed-hull — ZFC Set10 Power Set Closed Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (base set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (candidate hull set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in H\">\\(u\\in H\\)</span> (element of the hull)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (comparison set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(u)\">\\(\\mathcal P(u)\\)</span> (power set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10PowerSetClosedHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10PowerSetClosedHull}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}power\\text{-}set\\text{-}closed\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10PowerSetClosedHull}_S(H,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\forall u\\in H\\;(\\mathcal{P}(u)\\in H)\\land\\forall K\\;\\left(\\left(A\\subseteq K\\land\\forall u\\in K\\;(\\mathcal{P}(u)\\in K)\\right)\\to H\\subseteq K\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}power\\text{-}set\\text{-}closed\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10PowerSetClosedHull}_S(H,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq H\\land\\forall u\\in H\\;(\\mathcal{P}(u)\\in H)\\land\\forall K\\;\\left(\\left(A\\subseteq K\\land\\forall u\\in K\\;(\\mathcal{P}(u)\\in K)\\right)\\to H\\subseteq K\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimality clause makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> the least power-set-closed set containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, rather than an arbitrary closed superset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin